  "description": "A prototype implementation of a polarized type system featuring higher-order unification and bidirectional type checking. The engine manages a context of solved and unsolved existential variables to facilitate type inference across complex constructs including universal/existential quantification and linear-adjacent types. It provides a unified syntax for expressions, values, and patterns, emphasizing modularity in sort and polarity handling.",
